      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DYNAMIC BELLA (1) is in sizzling form lately, rocketing around this track in 20.61 to score two back then following on with a 20.46 win over 365m at this track. In form and looks the one to beat again. UNDERCOVER BEAR (2) racing well without winning, placing at his last six runs. Last start finished 2nd on October 21 over 365m at this track behind DYNAMIC BELLA beaten 1.75 lengths (20.58) in a Grade 5. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Overdue and is among the main hopes. EGOMANIAC (4) was long overdue after two placings in a row before a deserved win (20.69) last time at this track. Solid record here winning two races. Best form too dangerous to ignore. Have to include. TAYLORS ERA (7) is chasing another win after a swift 20.71 win latest. Don't underestimate.",
